    "body": "<div class=\"govspeak\"><p>We are seeking views on proposed policy changes to the <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.caa.co.uk/media/lzrl3drs/caa-air-navigation-directions-2023.pdf\">air navigation directions (<abbr title=\"air navigation directions\">AND</abbr>)</a> and <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/uk-air-navigation-guidance-2017\">air navigation guidance (<abbr title=\"air navigation guidance\">ANG</abbr>)</a>.</p>\n\n<p>The <abbr title=\"air navigation directions\">AND</abbr> and <abbr title=\"air navigation guidance\">ANG</abbr> are statutory documents issued to the Civil Aviation Authority (CAA) to inform them how to carry out their air navigation function. They were last updated in 2023 and 2017 respectively.</p>\n\n<p>We are consulting on several proposed policy changes, with the aim of:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>outlining our priorities and policies for designing new airspace</li>\n  <li>streamlining processes to improve the implementation of the <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/airspace-modernisation\">airspace modernisation programme</a>\n</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>The proposed changes include:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>providing clear priorities for the design of airspace, including the altitude at which noise and carbon are prioritised</li>\n  <li>implementing new time limits on the call-in process</li>\n  <li>updating guidance on the engagement and consultation process</li>\n  <li>removing the need for environmental assessments for unmanned aerial systems trials</li>\n  <li>improving the overall usability of the information</li>\n</ul>\n\n</div>",
