    "final_outcome_detail": "<div class=\"govspeak\"><p>This document provides the government response to the consultation.</p>\n\n<p>As a result of the consultation, we have also published:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/uk-air-navigation-directions-2026\">UK air navigation directions 2026</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/uk-air-navigation-guidance-2026\">UK air navigation guidance 2026</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/airspace-modernisation-air-navigation-directions-and-guidance\">an impact assessment on options for supporting the <abbr title=\"Civil Aviation Authority\">CAA</abbr> to deliver the airspace modernisation programme</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n</div>",
